### api call for listing all turf bookings
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/
Accept: application/json

### api call for adding turf booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "xavier",
    "turf_name": "squareteam",
    "sport": "badminton",
    "booking_date": "2026-03-22",
    "booking_time": "7:00",
    "duration": 2,
    "amount": 1500
}

### api call for retrieving one booking

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/1/
Accept: application/json

### api call for updating turf booking
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "Vismaya",
    "turf_name": "Green Arena",
    "sport": "badminton",
    "booking_date": "2026-3-22",
    "booking_time": "8:00",
    "duration": 3,
    "amount": 2000
}

### api call for deleting turf booking
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/turf/2/
Accept: application/json


### serializer
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/turf/
Accept: application/json


